{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And if a creation HaShem will create.</b> It does not refer to the mouth of the earth, for it was already created during the six days of creation, according to the words of our Rabbis. And Scripture is witness: <b>ופצתה האדמה את פיה</b> — this implies it was already created. Moreover, regarding Cain it is written ״אשר פצתה את פיה״. Rather, this is what it says: if a new thing that never was from the beginning until now — now will HaShem, blessed be He, create it. And what is it? To bring down living people to Sheol."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:17.895500583Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}